# GENERATED — do not edit by hand. Regenerate with
# scripts/project-dao-glossary-graph.mjs after editing a term's
# data/records/glossary/terms/<term>.v1.json or content/text/glossary/terms/<term>.md.
# One simplification, stated plainly: daod:groundingMethod is asserted once per
# Term (from its first translation's grounding), since every term in this glossary
# happens to ground all of its renderings the same way; a term that ever mixes
# grounding methods across renderings would need a richer per-rendering shape.

